   "res#60602/whatIHaveToSay[0]",
   "Manshroom",
   "Is natural, no. Made by evil. Mushroom good for food, hat. Not for enemy.",
   "是天生的？不。邪恶造的。蘑菇能做吃的、做帽子。不当敌人。"
