   "res#60678/whatIHaveToSay[0]",
   "silver",
   "Scaphin no use. But have many. Bring thread, I give silver. Wish understand cloth.",
   "斯卡芬，用不上。但有很多。带线来，我给银子。想弄懂布。"
  ],
  [
   "res#60687/whatIHaveToSay[0]",
   "dark lord",
   "Make the evil sauce! Deep deep it is. The sauce make want evil!",
